  m_text: 'DEFEND THE SOUL CRYSTAL


    1. Choose a defender card.


    2. Tap
    an empty board tile to deploy.

    Placement costs Soul Energy.


    3. Defenders
    attack automatically.

    Enemies advance from the top.


    4. Keep enemies
    away from the crystal

    and survive each wave.


    Soul Energy regenerates
    over time.

    Watch your energy and crystal health.'
